  </form>\n                    </div>\n                </aside>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"lk-section-space bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" id=\"payment-proof\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\">\n                <div class=\"mb-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"lk-kicker mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-1\">\n                            Le geste qui compte\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"lk-editorial m-0 max-w-[520px] text-[clamp(2.35rem,4vw,4rem)] leading-[1] tracking-[-.035em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Un règlement ne disparaît pas dans un relevé.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"m-0 max-w-[510px] text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#64635F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                        Dans Lokka, le paiement, la quittance et l’accès du locataire restent liés. Vous voyez ce qui vient d’arriver et ce qui doit être fait ensuite.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lk-proof-track mb-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"lk-proof-progress\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\" id=\"proof-line\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-0 md:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3\">\n                    <div class=\"lk-reveal border-l-0 border-[#E4E0D8] py-3 pr-7 md:border-r md:pr-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1\">\n                        <div class=\"lk-status text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1-1\">\n                            <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1-1-1\">\n                            </span>\n                            01 · Paiement confirmé\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"m-0 mt-5 text-[17px] font-bold tracking-[-.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1-2\">\n                            MTN MoMo ou Moov Money\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"lk-note mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1-3\">\n                            Le règlement est rapproché dans votre tableau de bord, avec le montant et le canal utilisés.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#F0EDE6] pt-3 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1-4\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1-4-1\">\n                                Koudjo Dossou\n                            </span>\n                            <strong class=\"lk-mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1-4-2\">\n                                350 000 FCFA\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"lk-reveal border-[#E4E0D8] py-3 px-0 md:border-r md:px-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2\">\n                        <div class=\"lk-status text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-1-1\">\n                            </span>\n                            02 · Document généré\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"m-0 mt-5 text-[17px] font-bold tracking-[-.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-2\">\n                            La quittance devient une preuve\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"lk-note mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-3\">\n                            Référence LOK-2026-0891, PDF officiel et QR Code de vérification, sans ressaisie manuelle.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[#F0EDE6] pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-4\">\n                            <span class=\"lk-qr\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-4-1\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-qrcode\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-4-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"lk-mono text-[11px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-4-2\">\n                                LOK-2026-0891\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"lk-reveal py-3 pl-0 md:pl-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-3\">\n                        <div class=\"lk-status text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-3-1\">\n                            <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-3-1-1\">\n                            </span>\n                            03 · Locataire informé\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"m-0 mt-5 text-[17px] font-bold tracking-[-.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-3-2\">\n                            Le portail reste à jour\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"lk-note mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-3-3\">\n                            Avec son accès OTP, le locataire retrouve le bail, ses quittances et les informations de son logement.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-[#F0EDE6] pt-3 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-3-4\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-lock\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-3-4-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:14px\">\n                            </i>\n                            OTP actif · sans mot de passe complexe\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"lk-section-space border-t border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#FAF9F6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" id=\"fonctionnement\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1240px] gap-10 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[150px_minmax(0,1fr)_250px] lg:gap-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\">\n                <aside class=\"lk-index hidden lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1\">\n                        Dossier de location\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"lk-index-link\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2\" href=\"#top\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-1\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                        Aperçu\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"lk-index-link is-current\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-3\" href=\"#fonctionnement\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-3-1\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                        Bail, locataire, paiement\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"lk-index-link\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-4\" href=\"#agence-file\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-4-1\">\n                            03\n                        </span>\n                        Mandats\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"lk-index-link\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-5\" href=\"#vitrine\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-5-1\">\n                            04\n                        </span>\n                        Vitrine\n                    </a>\n                </aside>\n                <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\">\n                    <p class=\"lk-kicker mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1\">\n                        Le dossier de location\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"lk-editorial m-0 max-w-[700px] text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.8vw,4.5rem)] leading-[.98] tracking-[-.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                        Un paiement ne vit jamais seul.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[630px] text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#64635F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3\">\n                        Chaque pièce du dossier est reliée à la suivante : le bail fixe la règle, le locataire reçoit l’accès, le règlement crée la trace et la quittance clôture l’opération.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"lk-sheet mt-10 p-5 sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] pb-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1-1\">\n                                <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1-1-1\">\n                                    Dossier · Villa Les Cocotiers / Appartement 4B\n                                </div>\n                                <h3 class=\"m-0 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-.025em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1-1-2\">\n                                    Koudjo Dossou\n                                </h3>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1-2\">\n                                4 enregistrements liés\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div aria-label=\"Pièces du dossier de location\" class=\"lk-tabs mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2\" role=\"tablist\">\n                            <button aria-controls=\"lease-panel\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"lk-tab\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-1\" data-leaf=\"lease\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                Bail\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-controls=\"tenant-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"lk-tab\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-2\" data-leaf=\"tenant\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                Locataire\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-controls=\"payment-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"lk-tab\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-3\" data-leaf=\"payment\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                Règlement\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-controls=\"receipt-panel\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"lk-tab\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-4\" data-leaf=\"receipt\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                                Quittance\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"lk-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3\" data-panel=\"lease\" id=\"lease-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n                            <div class=\"grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_220px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-status text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-1-1\">\n                                        <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-1-1-1\">\n                                        </span>\n                                        Règle appliquée\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"m-0 mt-4 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.025em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-1-2\">\n                                        La caution est limitée à trois mois.\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"lk-note mt-3 max-w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-1-3\">\n                                        Le bail numérique conserve les mentions importantes de la location et rappelle la règle de la Loi n° 2022-30 au moment où le dossier est créé.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <dl class=\"m-0 border-l border-[#E4E0D8] pl-5 text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-2-1\">\n                                        <dt class=\"text-[#9B978F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-2-1-1\">\n                                            Référence bail\n                                        </dt>\n                                        <dd class=\"m-0 mt-1 font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-2-1-2\">\n                                            B-2026-44\n                                        </dd>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-2-2\">\n                                        <dt class=\"text-[#9B978F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-2-2-1\">\n                                            Loyer mensuel\n                                        </dt>\n                                        <dd class=\"lk-mono m-0 mt-1 font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                                            180 000 FCFA\n                                        </dd>\n                                    </div>\n                                </dl>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"lk-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4\" data-panel=\"tenant\" hidden=\"\" id=\"tenant-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n                            <div class=\"grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_220px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-status text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-1-1\">\n                                        <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-1-1-1\">\n                                        </span>\n                                        Accès sécurisé\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"m-0 mt-4 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.025em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-1-2\">\n                                        Le locataire entre avec un code OTP.\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"lk-note mt-3 max-w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-1-3\">\n                                        Son portail affiche son logement, son loyer, ses documents et ses incidents sans exiger de mot de passe complexe.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"border-l border-[#E4E0D8] pl-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-2-1\">\n                                        Portail locataire\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-2-2\">\n                                        OTP WhatsApp / SMS\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"lk-mini-status mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-2-3\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-file-invoice\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-4-1-2-3-1\">\n                                        </i>\n                                        2 quittances disponibles\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"lk-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5\" data-panel=\"payment\" hidden=\"\" id=\"payment-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n                            <div class=\"grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_220px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-status text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-1-1\">\n                                        <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-1-1-1\">\n                                        </span>\n                                        Règlement rapproché\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"m-0 mt-4 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.025em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-1-2\">\n                                        350 000 FCFA reçus par MTN MoMo.\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"lk-note mt-3 max-w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-1-3\">\n                                        Le canal, le montant et la date sont conservés dans l’historique du bien pour éviter les recherches dans plusieurs conversations.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"border-l border-[#E4E0D8] pl-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-2-1\">\n                                        État du paiement\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-2-2\">\n                                        Confirmé\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"lk-record-meta mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-5-1-2-3\">\n                                        02/09/2026 · 09:42\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"lk-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6\" data-panel=\"receipt\" hidden=\"\" id=\"receipt-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n                            <div class=\"grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_220px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-status text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-1-1\">\n                                        <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-1-1-1\">\n                                        </span>\n                                        Document prêt\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"m-0 mt-4 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.025em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-1-2\">\n                                        La quittance officielle porte sa propre référence.\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"lk-note mt-3 max-w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-1-3\">\n                                        Le PDF reprend le montant, la période, le logement et le QR Code associé à LOK-2026-0891.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l border-[#E4E0D8] pl-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"lk-qr\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-2-1\">\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-qrcode\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-2-1-1\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </span>\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-2-2\">\n                                        <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-2-2-1\">\n                                            QR Code\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"lk-mono text-[12px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-6-1-2-2-2\">\n                                            LOK-2026-0891\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-3 border-t border-[#E4E0D8] pt-5 text-[12px] text-[#64635F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-5\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-5-1\">\n                            <strong class=\"text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-5-1-1\">\n                                Caution :\n                            </strong>\n                            3 mois maximum\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-5-2\">\n                            <strong class=\"text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-5-2-1\">\n                                Portail :\n                            </strong>\n                            OTP actif\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-5-3\">\n                            <strong class=\"text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-5-3-1\">\n                                Document :\n                            </strong>\n                            PDF + QR Code\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <aside class=\"lg:pt-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3\">\n                    <div class=\"lk-legal-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-1\">\n                        <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-1-1\">\n                            La règle, au bon endroit\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] font-semibold leading-[1.45] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-1-2\">\n                            Pas un badge “conforme”. Une limite visible dans le dossier.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"lk-note mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-1-3\">\n                            Lokka aide à appliquer la caution maximale prévue par la Loi n° 2022-30. Le document reste lisible avant la signature.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </aside>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"lk-section-space border-t border-[#E4E0D8] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" id=\"agence-file\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-7 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] pb-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"lk-kicker mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-1\">\n                            Mandats & propriétaires\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"lk-editorial m-0 max-w-[700px] text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.7vw,4.5rem)] leading-[.98] tracking-[-.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Le mandat garde le lien entre loyer et reversement.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Choisir une vue de gestion\" class=\"lk-role-switch\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"view switch buttons container\" role=\"tablist\">\n                        <button aria-selected=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-role=\"bailleur\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                            Vue bailleur\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-selected=\"false\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2\" data-role=\"agence\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                            Vue agence\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-selected=\"false\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-3\" data-role=\"diaspora\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">\n                            Diaspora\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-10 pt-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.7fr_.8fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-1-1\">\n                                    Registre agence\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[18px] font-bold tracking-[-.02em]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"mandats heading display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-heading\">\n                                    Mandats actifs & reversements\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-right\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"mandats count display\" data-reason=\"number updated by role switch script\">\n                                <div class=\"lk-value lk-mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-2-1\" id=\"role-count\">\n                                    24\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-record-meta\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                                    mandats actifs\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-7 border-y border-[#E4E0D8]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <div class=\"lk-record-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-record-title\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"row one title display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-row-one-title\">\n                                        Encaissements des locataires\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"lk-record-meta mt-1\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"row one note display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-row-one-note\">\n                                        Loyers rapprochés sur les biens sous mandat\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-value-sm lk-mono\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"row one value display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-row-one-value\">\n                                    8 500 000 FCFA\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"lk-record-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-record-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                        Commission de gestion\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"lk-record-meta mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                        Plafond affiché selon le dossier agence\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-value-sm lk-mono\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"row two value display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-row-two-value\">\n                                    850 000 FCFA\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"lk-record-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-3\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-3-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"lk-record-title\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"row three title display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-row-three-title\">\n                                        Reversements à préparer\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"lk-record-meta mt-1\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"row three note display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-row-three-note\">\n                                        Montant à distribuer aux propriétaires mandants\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-value-sm lk-mono text-[#A15C00]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"row three value display\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-row-three-value\">\n                                    7 650 000 FCFA\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3\">\n                            <span class=\"lk-kicker shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3-1\">\n                                Flux du mandat\n                            </span>\n                            <div class=\"lk-connector flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3-2\">\n                                <div class=\"lk-connector-fill\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3-2-1\" id=\"agency-line\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"lk-status shrink-0 text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3-3\">\n                                <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-green\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3-3-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Suivi\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <aside class=\"lk-legal-note self-start lg:mt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1\">\n                            Vue sélectionnée\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] font-semibold leading-[1.45] text-[#18181B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"role description text\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-note\">\n                            Vous voyez l’argent encaissé, la commission et ce qui revient à chaque propriétaire.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"lk-note mt-3\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"role description detail\" data-reason=\"text updated by role switch script\" id=\"role-note-detail\">\n                            Les propriétaires mandants ne disparaissent pas derrière un total d’agence.\n                        </p>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"lk-section-space border-t border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#FAF9F6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" id=\"vitrine\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] lg:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"lk-kicker mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1\">\n                            Biens disponibles\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"lk-editorial m-0 text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.6vw,4.3rem)] leading-[.98] tracking-[-.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Publier n’efface pas le dossier.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"m-0 max-w-[500px] text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#64635F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\">\n                        Un logement vacant part de votre portefeuille, puis devient une annonce claire à partager avec vos futurs locataires.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-0 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_110px_1fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"lk-sheet-flat p-6 sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-1-1\">\n                                    Dans votre portefeuille\n                                </div>\n                                <h3 class=\"m-0 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.025em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-1-2\">\n                                    Appartement F3 Standing\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#64635F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-1-3\">\n                                    Arconville · Calavi\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"lk-status text-[#A15C00]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                <span class=\"lk-status-dot lk-status-dot-amber\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Vacant\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 border-t border-[#F0EDE6] pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    Loyer\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-value-sm lk-mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                    180 000 FCFA\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-record-meta mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1-3\">\n                                    par mois\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                <div class=\"lk-kicker mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    État\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-record-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                                    À publier\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"lk-record-meta mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2-3\">\n                                    Vitrine + Marketplace\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"lk-button lk-button-dark mt-8 w-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-3\" type=\"button\">\n                            Publier l’annonce\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-3-1\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;font-size:15px;line-height:15px\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center py-7 lg:py-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\">\n                  