 · même référence · trois usages utiles pour la gestion quotidienne.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#FAF9F6] py-20 sm:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" id=\"control-room\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\">\n                <div class=\"reveal max-w-[630px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1\">\n                        Salle de contrôle\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-4 text-[clamp(2.15rem,4vw,3.8rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2\">\n                        Ce qui mérite votre attention,\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                        <span class=\"serif-display font-normal italic text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-2\">\n                            pas seulement ce qui va bien.\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[560px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-3\">\n                        Un portefeuille utile montre ses encaissements, mais aussi ce qui doit encore être décidé : retard, vacance, caution, reversement.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.55fr)_minmax(300px,0.85fr)] lg:gap-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"reveal border-y border-[#D1CBBF] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] px-5 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:px-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-1-1\"