 M\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid border-t border-[#E4E0D8] sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3\">\n                            <div class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] px-5 py-4 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-1\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-1-1\">\n                                    Taux de recouvrement\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-1-2\">\n                                    90%\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-1-3\">\n                                    sur les loyers attendus\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"px-5 py-4 sm:px-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-2\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-2-1\">\n                                    Occupation\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-2-2\">\n                                    80%\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3-2-3\">\n                                    4 / 5 biens loués\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal border-y border-[#D1CBBF] bg-[#F4F2EC] px-5 py-6 sm:px-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#D1CBBF] pb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                Une action à traiter\n                            </p>\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"alert triangle icon\" style=\"color:#B45309;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                            </i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-[#B45309]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                Retard · J+6\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[22px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                Koudjo Dossou\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-3\">\n                                Villa Fidjrossè Plage\n                                <br data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-3-1\"/>\n                                <span class=\"tabular font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-3-2\">\n                                    150 000 FCFA\n                                </span>\n                                à relancer\n                            </p>\n                            <button class=\"mt-7 inline-flex min-h-[44px] w-full items-center justify-between border border-[#18181B] bg-white px-4 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#18181B] hover:bg-[#18181B] hover:text-white\" data-action-toggle-2=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"view context action button\" type=\"button\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-4-1\">\n                                    Voir le contexte\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-4-2\" style=\"color:currentColor;width:16px;height:16px\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                            <div class=\"action-detail mt-4 border-t border-[#D1CBBF] pt-4 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-action-detail-2=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-5\">\n                                <p class=\"font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-5-1\">\n                                    Relance WhatsApp automatique envoyée.\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2-5-2\">\n                                    +229 97 00 11 22 · prochaine vérification dans 24 h.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-[#D1CBBF] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3-1\">\n                                Règle appliquée\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-semibold leading-relaxed text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3-2\">\n                                Caution limitée à 3 mois selon la Loi n° 2022-30.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-white py-20 sm:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" id=\"roles\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.78fr_2.22fr] lg:gap-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"reveal\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-1\">\n                            Même système, autre focale\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-4 text-[clamp(2rem,3.8vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Votre métier change.\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                            <span class=\"serif-display font-normal italic text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-2-2\">\n                                Le contrôle reste.\n                            </span>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-3\">\n                            Choisissez la vue qui ressemble à votre quotidien. Les mêmes données restent reliées, sans multiplier les outils.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal border border-[#D1CBBF] bg-[#FAF9F6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\">\n                        <div aria-label=\"Vues Lokka\" class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-[#D1CBBF] p-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"role selection tablist\" role=\"tablist\">\n                            <button aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"role-tab min-h-[42px] flex-1 rounded-[5px] px-4 text-[12px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"landlord role button\" data-role=\"bailleur\" type=\"button\">\n                                Vue bailleur\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"role-tab min-h-[42px] flex-1 rounded-[5px] px-4 text-[12px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"agency role button\" data-role=\"agence\" type=\"button\">\n                                Vue agence\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"role-tab min-h-[42px] flex-1 rounded-[5px] px-4 text-[12px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"diaspora role button\" data-role=\"diaspora\" type=\"button\">\n                                Vue diaspora\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2\">\n                            <div class=\"border-b border-[#D1CBBF] px-5 py-7 sm:px-7 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1\">\n                                <div class=\"role-panel is-active\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"landlord role panel\" data-role-panel=\"bailleur\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                                        Je gère mes biens\n                                    </p>\n                                    <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                                        Loyers, occupation, locataires.\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[420px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-3\">\n                                        Une vue directe sur ce qui est encaissé, ce qui manque et ce que votre locataire peut déjà retrouver dans son portail.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 border-y border-[#E4E0D8]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"border-r border-[#E4E0D8] py-4 pr-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-4-1\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-4-1-1\">\n                                                Encaissé\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-4-1-2\">\n                                                1 450 000 F\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"py-4 pl-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-4-2\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-4-2-1\">\n                                                Occupation\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-4-2-2\">\n                                                4 / 5 lots\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <button class=\"mt-7 inline-flex min-h-[42px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#18181B] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-5\" data-scroll-target=\"#signup-final\" type=\"button\">\n                                        Inviter un locataire\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-1-5-1\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:15px;height:15px\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"role-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"agency role panel\" data-role-panel=\"agence\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                                        Je gère pour des propriétaires\n                                    </p>\n                                    <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                                        Mandats, commissions, reversements.\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[420px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-3\">\n                                        Les loyers encaissés restent liés aux mandats actifs et aux reversements à préparer pour chaque propriétaire.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 border-y border-[#E4E0D8]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"border-r border-[#E4E0D8] py-4 pr-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-4-1\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-4-1-1\">\n                                                Mandats actifs\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-4-1-2\">\n                                                24\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"py-4 pl-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-4-2\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-4-2-1\">\n                                                Reversements\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-4-2-2\">\n                                                7,65 M F\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <button class=\"mt-7 inline-flex min-h-[42px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#18181B] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-5\" data-scroll-target=\"#signup-final\" type=\"button\">\n                                        Créer un mandat\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-2-5-1\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:15px;height:15px\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"role-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"diaspora role panel\" data-role-panel=\"diaspora\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-1\">\n                                        Depuis l'étranger\n                                    </p>\n                                    <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-2\">\n                                        Un regard à distance, sans angle mort.\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[420px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-3\">\n                                        Suivez vos biens à Cotonou depuis Paris ou ailleurs, avec l'affichage FCFA / Euro ou Dollar et l'archive de vos documents.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 border-y border-[#E4E0D8]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"border-r border-[#E4E0D8] py-4 pr-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-4-1\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-4-1-1\">\n                                                Règlements\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-4-1-2\">\n                                                1,45 M F\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"py-4 pl-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-4-2\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-4-2-1\">\n                                                Archive\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-4-2-2\">\n                                                FCFA · € · $\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <button class=\"mt-7 inline-flex min-h-[42px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#18181B] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-5\" data-scroll-target=\"#signup-final\" type=\"button\">\n                                        Voir mes documents\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2-1-3-5-1\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:15px;height:15