    </div>\n                            <div class=\"py-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"stat occupancy\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                                    Occupation\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-2 text-[29px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.05em] tabular text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                                    4\n                                    <span class=\"mx-1 text-[18px] font-medium text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"divider\">\n                                        /\n                                    </span>\n                                    5\n                                    <span class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold tracking-normal\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"stat sub-label\">\n                                        biens loués\n                                    </span>\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"stat note\">\n                                    1 logement disponible à publier\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"pt-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"sidebar sign up form\" id=\"signup\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"form title\">\n                                Créer votre espace\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"form description\">\n                                Un code de connexion sera envoyé à votre adresse email.\n                            </p>\n                            <form class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"input form\" data-otp-form=\"\">\n                                <label class=\"block text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"email input label\" for=\"hero-email\">\n                                    Adresse email\n                                </label>\n                                <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row lg:flex-col xl:flex-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"email field container\">\n                                    <input class=\"min-h-[44px] min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-[6px] border border-[#D1CBBF] bg-white px-3 text-[13px] text-[#18181B] placeholder:text-[#9C9A95]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"email input field\" id=\"hero-email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"vous@exemple.com\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/>\n                                    <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-[44px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[6px] bg-[#18181B] px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#27272A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"submit button\" type=\"submit\">\n                                        Créer mon espace\n                                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"arrow-right icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#FFFFFF;\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3-3\" data-name=\"trial notice\">\n                                    Essai gratuit 14 jours · Sans carte bancaire\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-3 hidden text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#087F5B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-3-3-4\" data-name=\"otp feedback message\" data-otp-feedback=\"\" data-reason=\"feedback message dynamically updated by script\" role=\"status\">\n                                </p>\n                            </form>\n                        </div>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"js-section-reveal border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow section\" id=\"workflow\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 lg:px-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow content container\">\n                <div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow grid layout\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow text column\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow pre-headline\">\n                            Du règlement au document\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[500px] text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"workflow headline\">\n                            Quand un loyer est payé,\n                            <span class=\"briefing-serif font-normal text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow highlighted text\">\n                                rien ne se perd.\n                            </span>\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[500px] text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"workflow description\">\n                            Le