      </blockquote>\n                        <figcaption class=\"mt-5 text-[12px] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial author\">\n                            <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial author name\">\n                                Aïcha Houndété\n                            </strong>\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                            Propriétaire bailleur · Calavi · 8 logements\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"border-l-2 border-[#18181B] pl-5 lg:col-span-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 2\">\n                        <blockquote class=\"text-[16px] font-medium leading-[1.6] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial quote\">\n                            “Le double affichage FCFA / Euros me permet de gérer mes biens à Cotonou depuis Paris.”\n                        </blockquote>\n                        <figcaption class=\"mt-5 text-[12px] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial author\">\n                            <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial author name\">\n                                Dr. Fabrice Tossou\n                            </strong>\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                            Investisseur diaspora · Paris & Cotonou · 6 biens\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 max-w-[780px] border-l-2 border-[#D1CBBF] pl-5 lg:ml-auto\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 3\">\n                    <blockquote class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial quote\">\n                        “Le site vitrine généré en 1 clic et les Comptes-Rendus de Gestion édités pour nos propriétaires mandants ont changé notre quotidien.”\n                    </blockquote>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial author\">\n                        <strong class=\"text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial author name\">\n                            Aristide Gbaguidi\n                        </strong>\n                        · Directeur d'agence immobilière · Cotonou Haie Vive · 24 lots\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"js-section-reveal border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" data-name=\"pricing section\" id=\"pricing\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 lg:px-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"pricing container\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] pb-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"pricing header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pricing title block\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pricing pre-headline\">\n                            Tarifs en FCFA\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-4 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.3rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"pricing main headline\">\n                            Choisissez le niveau de contrôle dont vous avez besoin.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"billing switcher\">\n                        <span