atrimoine · Loyers · Quittances · Vitrine\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-medium text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-2-2-2\">\n                            Un seul espace, des traces claires.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-white px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" id=\"automation\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.8fr] lg:gap-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\">\n                <div class=\"reveal\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                        Les automatismes utiles\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4.2rem)] font-semibold leading-[.96] tracking-[-.065em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                        Un loyer payé.\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                        <span class=\"serif font-normal italic text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                            Trois traces fiables.\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[350px] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3\">\n                        Lokka ne s’arrête pas à l’encaissement. Le même événement met à jour votre suivi, votre document et l’espace du locataire.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal border-y border-[#D1CBBF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"grid gap-0 md:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"relative border-b border-[#E4E0D8] px-1 py-7 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:pr-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center border border-[#18181B] text-[11px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1-1\">\n                                    01\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-device-mobile icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1-2\" style=\"color:#087F5B;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                Encaissement\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-3\">\n                                MTN MoMo / Moov Money\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1-4\">\n                                Le règlement arrive dans le suivi du mois avec son montant et son canal.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative border-b border-[#E4E0D8] px-1 py-7 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center border border-[#18181B] text-[11px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    02\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-file-invoice icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1-2\" style=\"color:#087F5B;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                Document\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-3\">\n                                Quittance PDF + QR\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2-4\">\n                                La référence LOK-2026-0891 devient une preuve facile à retrouver.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"px-1 py-7 md:pl-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-3\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-3-1\">\n                                <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center border border-[#18181B] text-[11px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-3-1-1\">\n                                    03\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-lock-access icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-3-1-2\" style=\"color:#087F5B;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-3-2\">\n                                Accès\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-3-3\">\n                                Portail locataire OTP\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-3-4\">\n                                Le locataire retrouve son document sans mot de passe complexe.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-[#E4E0D8] py-4 text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                        Même paiement · même référence · trois usages utiles pour la gestion quotidienne.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#FAF9F6] px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" id=\"features\">\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-[38%] opacity-30 quiet-grid [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_left,black,transparent)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.45fr] lg:gap-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2\">\n                <div class=\"reveal lg:sticky lg:top-10 lg:self-start\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-1\">\n                        Le contrôle reste lisible\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4.2rem)] font-semibold leading-[.96] tracking-[-.065em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2\">\n                        Chaque opération\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2-1\"/>\n                        <span class=\"serif font-normal italic text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2-2\">\n                            laisse une trace.\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[365px] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-3\">\n                        Des outils concrets pour éviter les oublis : un bail, une échéance, un retard ou une annonce disponible se lit au même endroit.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[#D1CBBF] pt-4 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-4\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-shield-check icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-4-1\" style=\"color:#087F5B;width:17px;height:17px\">\n                        </i>\n                        Loi n° 2022-30 intégrée dans vos règles\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal border-t border-[#D1CBBF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2\">\n                    <button class=\"feature-line group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] py-6 text-left\" data-feature-row=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1\" type=\"button\">\n                        <span class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1-1\">\n                            <span class=\"tabular pt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#9C9A95]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                                01\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                                    Encaissements Mobile Money\n                                </strong>\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 block max-w-[560px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                                    Suivez les loyers encaissés, les retards et les impayés avec MTN MoMo et Moov Money.\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right feature-arrow icon mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1-2\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"feature-line group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] py-6 text-left\" data-feature-row=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2\" type=\"button\">\n                        <span class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"tabular pt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#9C9A95]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                02\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                                    Baux et cautions conformes\n                                </strong>\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 block max-w-[560px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                                    La caution reste limitée à trois mois et vos documents gardent les mentions essentielles de la Loi 2022-30.\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right feature-arrow icon mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-2\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"feature-line group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] py-6 text-left\" data-feature-row=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3\" type=\"button\">\n                        <span class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3-1\">\n                            <span class=\"tabular pt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#9C9A95]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3-1-1\">\n                                03\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3-1-2\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3-1-2-1\">\n                                    Portail locataire sans mot de passe\n                                </strong>\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 block max-w-[560px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                                    Invitez un locataire par OTP, donnez-lui accès à ses quittances et recevez les incidents au même endroit.\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right feature-arrow icon mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3-2\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"feature-line group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-[#E4E0D8] py-6 text-left\" data-feature-row=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4\" type=\"button\">\n                        <span class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-1\">\n                            <span class=\"tabular pt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#9C9A95]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-1-1\">\n                                04\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-1-2\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-1-2-1\">\n                                    Reporting et pilotage\n                                </strong>\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 block max-w-[560px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-1-2-2\">\n                                    Lisez vos revenus, votre taux de recouvrement, votre occupation et les vues de vos annonces.\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right feature-arrow icon mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-2\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:18px;height:18px\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-white px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" id=\"proof\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid border-y border-[#D1CBBF] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] px-1 py-6 sm:border-r lg:border-b-0 lg:px-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"tabular text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-.06em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-1\">\n                            100\n                            <span class=\"text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-1-1\">\n                                +\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-2\">\n                            bailleurs & gestionnaires\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] px-1 py-6 sm:px-5 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\">\n                        <p class=\"tabular text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-.06em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1\">\n                            450\n                            <span class=\"text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                                +\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2\">\n                            logements sous gestion\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] px-1 py-6 sm:border-r sm:px-5 lg:border-b-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3\">\n                        <p class=\"tabular text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-.06em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3-1\">\n                            98,2\n                            <span class=\"text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3-1-1\">\n                                %\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3-2\">\n                            recouvrement MoMo\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"px-1 py-6 sm:px-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4\">\n                        <p class=\"tabular text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-.06em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4-1\">\n                            100\n                            <span class=\"text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4-1-1\">\n                                %\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4-2\">\n                            conforme Loi 2022-30\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\">\n                    Repères de démonstration Lokka à contextualiser avec une source ou une date avant publication.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#FAF9F6] px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" id=\"showcase\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\">\n                <div class=\"reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-7 lg:flex-row lg:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1\">\n                            Acquisition & vitrine\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-5 max-w-[700px] text-[clamp(2.3rem,4.5vw,4.8rem)] font-semibold leading-[.95] tracking-[-.07em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Un bien vacant devient\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                            <span class=\"serif font-normal italic text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2-2\">\n                                visible en un geste.\n                            </span>\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[330px] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\">\n                        Publiez les données déjà présentes dans votre portefeuille. Pas besoin d’un deuxième outil pour recevoir une demande de visite.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal mt-12 grid overflow-hidden border border-[#D1CBBF] bg-white lg:grid-cols-[1fr_96px_1fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E4E0D8] pb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                Dans votre portefeuille\n                            </p>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#B45309]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                À publier\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                Logement disponible\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-.045em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                Appartement F3 Standing\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-3\">\n                                Arconville, Calavi ·\n                                <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-3-1\">\n                                    180 000 FCFA / mois\n                                </strong>\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-3 text-[11px] text-[#52525B] sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-4\">\n                                <span class=\"border-t border-[#E4E0D8] pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-4-1\">\n                                    Compteur SBEE personnel\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"border-t border-[#E4E0D8] pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-4-2\">\n                                    Forage avec surpresseur\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"border-t border-[#E4E0D8] pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-4-3\">\n                                    Climatisation installée\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"border-t border-[#E4E0D8] pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-4-4\">\n                                    384 visites précédentes\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center border-y border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#F4F2EC] p-4 lg:border-x lg:border-y-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\">\n                        <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[6px] bg-[#18181B] px-3 py-3 text-[10px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#087F5B] lg:[writing-mode:vertical-rl]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"publish announcement button\" data-publish-button=\"\" data-reason=\"label text replaced to 'Annonce publiée' by script\" type=\"button\">\n                            Publier l’annonce\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1-1\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;width:14px;height:14px\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E4E0D8] pb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-1\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                Sur votre vitrine\n                            </p>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                agence-littoral.lokka.bj\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-1\">\n                                Disponible immédiatement\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-.045em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-2\">\n                                Appartement F3 Standing · Calavi\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"tabular mt-3 text-[24px] font-bold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-3\">\n                                180 000\n                                <span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] font-medium tracking-normal text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-3-1\">\n                                    FCFA / mois\n                                </span>\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-4\">\n                                <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-[40px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-[#18181B] px-3 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#18181B] hover:bg-[#F4F2EC]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"request visit button\" data-reason=\"label text replaced to 'Visite demandée' by script\" data-request-button=\"\" type=\"button\">\n                                    Réserver une visite\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-calendar-event icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-4-1-1\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:14px;height:14px\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                                <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-[40px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#18181B] px-3 text-[11px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-4-2\" type=\"button\">\n                                    WhatsApp\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-brand-whatsapp icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-4-2-1\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;width:14px;height:14px\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"publish-state mt-4 items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-5\" data-publish-state=\"\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-circle-check icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-5-1\" style=\"color:#087F5B;width:15px;height:15px\">\n                                </i>\n                                Annonce publiée sur agence-littoral.lokka.bj\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"publish-state mt-3 items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-6\" data-request-state=\"\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-calendar-check icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2-6-1\" style=\"color:#087F5B;width:15px;height:15px\">\n                                </i>\n                                Demande de visite reçue\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-white px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" id=\"workflow\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\">\n                <div class=\"reveal max-w-[650px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-1\">\n                        Fonctionnement\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4.3rem)] font-semibold leading-[.95] tracking-[-.07em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-2\">\n                        Du premier bien\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                        <span class=\"serif font-normal italic text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-2-2\">\n                            au premier encaissement.\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[520px] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-3\">\n                        Un parcours simple, pensé pour les bailleurs, les agences et les propriétaires qui suivent leurs biens depuis l’étranger.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal relative mt-14 border-y border-[#D1CBBF] py-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-line absolute left-0 right-0 top-[54px] hidden h-px origin-left bg-[#D1CBBF] lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#18181B] bg-white text-[11px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                01\n                            </span>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                Inscription + OTP\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-3\">\n                                Créez votre espace en 30 secondes avec votre email.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#18181B] bg-white text-[11px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                02\n                            </span>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                Premier bien et bail\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2-3\">\n                                Ajoutez un logement en FCFA et vérifiez la caution de 3 mois.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-3\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#18181B] bg-white text-[11px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-3-1\">\n                                03\n                            </span>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-3-2\">\n                                Règlement et quittance\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-3-3\">\n                                Validez MTN MoMo ou Moov Money, puis retrouvez le PDF officiel.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-4\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#087F5B] bg-[#E6F5EF] text-[11px] font-bold text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-4-1\">\n                                04\n                            </span>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-4-2\">\n                                Vitrine en un clic\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-4-3\">\n                                Publiez vos biens vacants et recevez une demande de visite.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#FAF9F6] px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" id=\"roles\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\">\n                <div class=\"reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-7 lg:flex-row lg:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-1\">\n                            Le même cockpit, votre quotidien\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4.3rem)] font-semibold leading-[.95] tracking-[-.07em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Bailleur, agence\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                            <span class=\"serif font-normal italic text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-2-2\">\n                                ou diaspora.\n                            </span>\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Vues par métier\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 border border-[#D1CBBF] bg-white p-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\" role=\"tablist\">\n                        <button aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"role-tab bg-[#18181B] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2-1\" data-role-tab=\"bailleur\" type=\"button\">\n                            Bailleur\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"role-tab px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2-2\" data-role-tab=\"agence\" type=\"button\">\n                            Agence\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"role-tab px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2-3\" data-role-tab=\"diaspora\" type=\"button\">\n                            Diaspora\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reveal mt-10 overflow-hidden border border-[#D1CBBF] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"role-view is-active\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1\" data-role-view=\"bailleur\">\n                        <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_270px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-1\">\n                                    Vue bailleur\n                                </p>\n                                <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-.045em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-2\">\n                                    Loyers, occupation, locataires.\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[560px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-3\">\n                                    Une vue directe sur ce qui est encaissé, ce qui manque et ce que votre locataire peut retrouver dans son portail.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mt-8 grid border-y border-[#E4E0D8] sm:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] py-4 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:pr-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-1\">\n                                        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-1-1\">\n                                            Encaissé\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[19px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-1-2\">\n                                            1 450 000 F\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#E4E0D8] py-4 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-2\">\n                                        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-2-1\">\n                                            À recouvrer\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[19px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-2-2\">\n                                            350 000 F\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"py-4 sm:pl-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-3\">\n                                        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-3-1\">\n                                            Occupation\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"tabular mt-1 text-[19px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-4-3-2\">\n                                            4 / 5 lots\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"border-t border-[#E4E0D8] bg-[#F4F2EC] p-6 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-[#71717A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                                    Action directe\n                                </p>\n                                <button class=\"mt-8 border-b border-[#18181B] pb-2 text-left text-[12px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2-2\" type=\"button\">\n                                    Inviter un locataire\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2-2-1\" style=\"color:#18181B;width:14px;height:14px\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                                <p class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2-3\">\n                                    Le locataire reçoit un accès OTP et ses quittances restent disponibles.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"role-view\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2\" data-role-view=\"agence\">\n                        <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_270px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-[#087F5B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                                    Vue agence\n                                </p>\n                                <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-.045em] text-[#18181B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                                    Le mandat garde le lien.\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[560px] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1-1-3\">\n                                    Séparez les encaissements